msgstr ""

#: admin/js/build/chunks/tab-docs.2aff582aa4df64b0.chunk.js:2
#: src/dashboard/components/dashboard/docs/Docs.js:211
msgid "If you'd rather avoid CORS altogether, exclude our plugin's script handles (text-to-audio-*, plyr) from WP Rocket → File Optimization → Delay JavaScript execution. That prevents the crossorigin attribute from being added in the first place. Fixing the header is still the more durable solution."
